equal to Type.

.. note:: Defaults to ``None``; kept as ``Type[...]`` (not ``Optional``) because
    ormatic cannot map ``Optional[Type]`` and would otherwise drop this column.""" ;
    rdfs:domain code:coraplex.robot_plans.actions.core.misc.DetectAction .

