:attr:`~coraplex.robot_plans.motions.gripper.MoveGripperMotion.stall_minimum_time`)
for the CLOSE motion. ``None`` keeps the default.""" ;
    rdfs:domain code:coraplex.robot_plans.actions.core.pick_up.PickUpAction ;
    rdfs:range xsd:double .

code:coraplex.robot_plans.actions.core.pick_up.PickUpAction.lift_linear_velocity a owl:DatatypeProperty,
